**============================================================================**

**PART II: VOWEL EMOTIONAL-ASPECT MAPPING (14 VOWELS)**

**============================================================================**

\@dataclass class VowelProfile: """Complete emotional-aspect profile for
a vowel.""" devanagari: str transliteration: str emotional_valence: str
direction: str aspect_bridge_source: str aspect_bridge_target: str
aspect_id: int vritti_affinity: str positive_emotion: str
negative_emotion: str acoustic_quality: str energetic_movement: str
spiritual_significance: str therapeutic_use: str

**Complete vowel emotional-aspect database**

