(original clarity)", positive_emotion="Primordial peace, original
innocence", negative_emotion="Existential void, primal fear",
acoustic_quality="Open throat, no constriction",
energetic_movement="Downward to root, grounding impulse",
spiritual_significance="AUM begins here - original sound",
therapeutic_use="Grounding, returning to origin, 'Ah' release" ),

